  "text_md": "<!-- image -->\n\n## Cross border co-ordination\n\n- Optimum timing of withdrawal likely to vary\n- Gains from information exchange and coordination:\n- Minimise cross-border distortions and arbitrage\n- Minimise collective action problems\n- Largest gains where spillover risks highest (such as deposit insurance and liability guarantees - eg Hong Kong/Singapore/Malaysia co-ordinating removal of exceptional retail deposit insurance)\n- Strengthening infrastructure and framework for foreign currency liquidity (G20 group)",
